   "resumo_en": "Violeta de Outono (Portuguese for \"Autumn Violet\") is the debut album from the eponymous Brazilian psychedelic rock band Violeta de Outono, released on July 7, 1987 by RCA Records. It was re-released in 2007 by Voiceprint Records, containing four bonus tracks.\nA music video for the track \"Dia Eterno\" was made; it was shot in 1987 at the National Observatory, in Rio de Janeiro. It is Violeta de Outono's only music video so far.",
