   "resumo_en": "Ilhas (Portuguese for \"Islands\") is the fourth studio album by Brazilian psychedelic rock band Violeta de Outono, released on May 9, 2005, by Voiceprint Records. It was the last album of the band to feature the original line-up of Fabio Golfetti, Cláudio Souza and Angelo Pastorello.\nThe track \"Dança\" previously appeared in Em Toda Parte, and was re-recorded for this release.\nJoão Parahyba of Trio Mocotó fame provided additional percussion instruments for some of the tracks.",
